<view class="page-shell companions-page"><page-nav title="伙伴" subtitle="{{title}}"></page-nav><view class="companions-top"><view class="section-label">一起成长的伙伴</view></view><view wx:if="{{companions.length}}" class="people-grid"><view wx:for="{{companions}}" wx:key="id" class="person-card card tap" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="avatar avatar-{{item.tone}}"><image wx:if="{{item.avatar}}" class="avatar-image" src="{{item.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" style="transform: translate({{item.avatarOffsetX}}rpx, {{item.avatarOffsetY}}rpx) scale({{item.avatarScale}});"></image><block wx:else><view class="avatar-face"></view><view class="avatar-shirt"></view></block></view><view class="person-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="person-gender">{{item.gender}}</view><view class="person-visibility">{{item.visibilityLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.introduction}}" class="person-intro">{{item.introduction}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">这里还没有伙伴。<view>点击底部“添加伙伴”创建第一位伙伴吧。</view></view><view class="note">伙伴信息只保存在当前设备，可随时编辑或删除。</view><view class="fixed-create-bar"><view class="fixed-create-button tap" bindtap="create">＋ 添加伙伴</view></view></view>
